<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DetectLogPro User Manual - PageTech</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <style>
        .manual-content {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .manual-hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--light-bg) 0%, var(--primary-color) 100%);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }
        .manual-hero img {
            max-width: 200px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .manual-hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--dark-brown);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .manual-hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }
        .toc {
            background: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(61, 40, 23, 0.1);
        }
        .toc h2 {
            color: var(--dark-brown);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
        }
        .toc ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }
        .toc li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .toc a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .toc a:hover {
            color: var(--dark-brown);
        }
        .toc ul ul {
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }
        .manual-section {
            background: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(61, 40, 23, 0.1);
        }
        .manual-section h2 {
            color: var(--dark-brown);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-color);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }
        .manual-section h3 {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }
        .manual-section h4 {
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin-top: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        .manual-section p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .manual-section ul, .manual-section ol {
            margin-left: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .manual-section li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .manual-section strong {
            color: var(--dark-brown);
        }
        .screenshot {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 4px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .screenshot-caption {
            text-align: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .icon-list {
            background: var(--light-bg);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        .icon-list li {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .note {
            background: #e3f2fd;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .warning {
            background: #fff3e0;
            border-left: 4px solid #ff9800;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .tip {
            background: #f1f8e9;
            border-left: 4px solid #8bc34a;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .faq-item {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
        }
        .faq-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .faq-question {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--dark-brown);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .faq-answer {
            color: var(--text-light);
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        table th {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--dark-brown);
            padding: 0.75rem;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        table td {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
        }
        table tr:hover {
            background: var(--light-bg);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav>
            <div class="logo">PageTech</div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="detectpro.html">DetectPro</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="support.html">Support</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero" style="min-height: 30vh;">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1>DetectPro User Manual</h1>
                <p class="tagline">Complete guide to using DetectPro</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="manual-content">
            <div class="manual-section">
                <h2>Getting Started</h2>
                <h3>Installation</h3>
                <p>DetectPro is available for iOS and Android devices. Download the app from your respective app store.</p>
                <ol>
                    <li>Search for "DetectPro" in the App Store or Google Play</li>
                    <li>Download and install the application</li>
                    <li>Open the app and complete the initial setup</li>
                    <li>Grant necessary permissions for location and camera access</li>
                </ol>

                <h3>First Time Setup</h3>
                <p>When you first launch DetectPro, you'll be guided through a quick setup process:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Create your detectorist profile</li>
                    <li>Set your preferred units of measurement</li>
                    <li>Configure location and notification settings</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="manual-section">
                <h2>Recording Finds</h2>
                <h3>Adding a New Find</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>Tap the "+" button on the main screen</li>
                    <li>Take or select photos of your find</li>
                    <li>Enter details such as type, material, and estimated period</li>
                    <li>Your location will be automatically recorded</li>
                    <li>Add any additional notes</li>
                    <li>Save your find to the database</li>
                </ol>

                <h3>Viewing Your Finds</h3>
                <p>Access all your recorded finds from the main database view. You can:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Filter by date, type, or location</li>
                    <li>Search for specific finds</li>
                    <li>View finds on a map</li>
                    <li>Export your data</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="manual-section">
                <h2>Advanced Features</h2>
                <h3>Map View</h3>
                <p>The map view displays all your finds geographically. Tap any marker to view details of that find.</p>

                <h3>Statistics</h3>
                <p>View comprehensive statistics about your detecting activities, including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Total number of finds</li>
                    <li>Finds by period</li>
                    <li>Finds by material</li>
                    <li>Most productive locations</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Exporting Data</h3>
                <p>Export your finds database in various formats (CSV, PDF) for backup or sharing purposes.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="manual-section">
                <h2>Settings</h2>
                <p>Customize DetectPro to your preferences:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Display units (metric/imperial)</li>
                    <li>Date format</li>
                    <li>Privacy settings</li>
                    <li>Data backup options</li>
                    <li>Notification preferences</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="manual-section">
                <h2>Tips and Best Practices</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Always record finds immediately while details are fresh</li>
                    <li>Take clear, well-lit photos from multiple angles</li>
                    <li>Be accurate with location data for future reference</li>
                    <li>Regularly backup your data</li>
                    <li>Keep the app updated for the latest features and improvements</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
                <a href="support.html" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Support</a>
                <a href="faq.html" class="btn btn-primary">View FAQs</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2026 PageTech. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Empowering detectorists with innovative technology</p>
            <p><a href="privacy.html" style="color: var(--accent-color); text-decoration: none;">Privacy Policy</a></p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
